      "body": "Aha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "Hearings are estimated at 15 days, with a result hoped for by the end of the year.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:49:22",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "Aha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "Witness testimony will be submitted in writing, and witnesses will then face cross-examination (questions from other parties).",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:44:53",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "Aha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "Open questions, including where hearings are held and whether they are streamed, will be decided after an October 1 prehearing.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:39:15",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "Aha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "The county attorney will update the board after the October 1 prehearing.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:39:02",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "Aha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "The permit applicants carry the burden to show how much water they need.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:37:46",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "Aha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "The attorney said the case is only about the 2026 and 2027 permits, not the long-term license.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:35:03",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "Aha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "Hearings are planned for Oʻahu, not Maui, but that is not yet decided.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:23:05",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "Aha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "A prehearing is set for October 1, with hearings November 4 and 5.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:22:30",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "Aha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "On September 11, the operator's attorney appealed the denial of its contested case request in circuit court.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:09:48",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "Aha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "Board of Land and Natural Resources (BLNR) rejected the operator's request for a contested case (a trial-like hearing) after an executive session (a closed-door discussion).",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:09:16",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "Aha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-23",
      "text": "Mahi Pono may appeal the denial of its contested case request in court within a set number of days.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "9vFQege7xis",
        "ts": "0:10:26",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:26:09.917Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Regional Community Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-23",
      "text": "The contested case process on the revocable permits will now start.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "9vFQege7xis",
        "ts": "0:10:15",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:26:09.917Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Regional Community Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-23",
      "text": "Board of Land and Natural Resources (BLNR) unanimously let its chair appoint a hearings officer to start that contested case for 2026 and 2027 permits.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "9vFQege7xis",
        "ts": "0:09:55",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:26:09.917Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Regional Community Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-23",
      "text": "About a month ago, a judge ordered Board of Land and Natural Resources (BLNR) to hold a contested case on the revocable permits.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
